{"content":[{"c":["GLEAN, GLEANING"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Practice of allowing the poor to follow reapers in a field to pick up missed spears of grain (cf. ",{"href":"?bref=Lev.19.9","r":"Lev.19.9","rawR":"Lev.19.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Lev.19.9","value":"Lev.19.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lv 19:9"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Lev.23.22","r":"Lev.23.22","rawR":"Lev.23.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Lev.23.22","value":"Lev.23.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"23:22"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Deut.24.19","r":"Deut.24.19","rawR":"Deut.24.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.24.19","value":"Deut.24.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 24:19"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ruth.2.2-23","r":"Ruth.2.2-23","rawR":"Ruth.2.2-23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ruth.2.2-23","value":"Ruth.2.2-23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ru 2:2-23"},"). Vineyards, as well as fields of grain, were to be available for gleaning (",{"href":"?bref=Lev.19.10","r":"Lev.19.10","rawR":"Lev.19.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Lev.19.10","value":"Lev.19.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lv 19:10"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Deut.24.20-21","r":"Deut.24.20-21","rawR":"Deut.24.20-21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.24.20-21","value":"Deut.24.20-21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 24:20-21"},"). Olive trees, however, were not to be gone over a second time (cf. ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.8.2","r":"Judg.8.2","rawR":"Judg.8.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.8.2","value":"Judg.8.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 8:2"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.17.6","r":"Isa.17.6","rawR":"Isa.17.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.17.6","value":"Isa.17.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 17:6"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.24.13","r":"Isa.24.13","rawR":"Isa.24.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.24.13","value":"Isa.24.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"24:13"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.6.9","r":"Jer.6.9","rawR":"Jer.6.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.6.9","value":"Jer.6.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 6:9"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Mic.7.1","r":"Mic.7.1","rawR":"Mic.7.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Mic.7.1","value":"Mic.7.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mi 7:1"},"). The word “gleaned” is also used to describe the killing of men who fled from a battle (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.20.45","r":"Judg.20.45","rawR":"Judg.20.45","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.20.45","value":"Judg.20.45"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 20:45"},", ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"GleanGleaning","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Lv 19:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Lev.19.9","rawQueryValue":"Lev.19.9","sourceRefExact":"Lev.19.9"},{"anchorText":"23:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Lev.23.22","rawQueryValue":"Lev.23.22","sourceRefExact":"Lev.23.22"},{"anchorText":"Dt 24:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.24.19","rawQueryValue":"Deut.24.19","sourceRefExact":"Deut.24.19"},{"anchorText":"Ru 2:2-23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ruth.2.2-23","rawQueryValue":"Ruth.2.2-23","sourceRefExact":"Ruth.2.2-23"},{"anchorText":"Lv 19:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Lev.19.10","rawQueryValue":"Lev.19.10","sourceRefExact":"Lev.19.10"},{"anchorText":"Dt 24:20-21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.24.20-21","rawQueryValue":"Deut.24.20-21","sourceRefExact":"Deut.24.20-21"},{"anchorText":"Jgs 8:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.8.2","rawQueryValue":"Judg.8.2","sourceRefExact":"Judg.8.2"},{"anchorText":"Is 17:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.17.6","rawQueryValue":"Isa.17.6","sourceRefExact":"Isa.17.6"},{"anchorText":"24:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.24.13","rawQueryValue":"Isa.24.13"